  "body": "ART 1.25.6, Windows, does what I have suggested/asked for.\n\nI am not really \"comfortable\" with the world of metadata, Exiftool's list says\n\n`0x0132 \tModifyDate \tstring \tIFD0 \t(called DateTime by the EXIF spec.)`[*](https://exiftool.org/TagNames/EXIF.html)\n\nIt looks to me, that this is it. Thank you!",
